WEBVTT

00:08:26.121 --> 00:08:30.496
a bit is that it's possible to
be an engaged workaholic.

00:08:31.496 --> 00:08:34.912
And this this has been differentiated
recently from being

00:08:34.912 --> 00:08:36.829
a compulsive workaholic. You know,

00:08:36.829 --> 00:08:39.871
are you are you working a lot because
you find it interesting

00:08:39.871 --> 00:08:41.912
and worthwhile, or are you doing it

00:08:41.912 --> 00:08:45.079
because you feel guilty when
you're not working

00:08:45.079 --> 00:08:48.537
and you feel kind of obsessed
with the with

00:08:48.537 --> 00:08:49.829
the problem that you're trying to solve?

00:08:49.829 --> 00:08:54.412
And I think that one version of engagement
is probably healthier than

00:08:54.412 --> 00:08:58.162
the other. And I associate wellbeing
much more with, you know,

00:08:58.162 --> 00:09:01.204
with being an intrinsically motivated
workaholic than with